ce">Management, Freelancing &amp; Craft</a></li></ul></details></li><li><details><summary>Business Building &amp; Independent Work</summary><ul><li><a href="/?forum=business-startups-operations">Startups, Small Business &amp; Operations</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=business-marketing-sales">Marketing, Sales &amp; Customer Relationships</a></li></ul></details></li><li><details><summary>Personal Finance &amp; Long-Term Planning</summary><ul><li><a href="/?forum=finance-budgeting-debt">Budgeting, Debt &amp; Financial Foundations</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=finance-investing-retirement">Investing, Retirement &amp; Long-Term Planning</a></li></ul></details></li><li><a href="/?forum=community-projects">Community Projects &amp; Mutual Aid</a></li><li><details><summary>Local Life &amp; Community Events</summary><ul><li><a href="/?forum=community-meetups-local">Meetups, Local Knowledge &amp; Events</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=community-volunteering-mutual-aid">Volunteering, Mutual Aid &amp; Community Projects</a></li></ul></details></li></ul></details></section><section><h4>INTERSTELLAR COMMONS · astronomy, worlds &amp; shared life</h4><details><summary>Interstellar Commons</summary><p>A shared place for astronomy, interstellar travel, planetary life, and multispecies civic culture.</p><ul><li><details><summary>Xenoculture, Art &amp; Shared Media</summary><ul><li><a href="/?forum=creative-xenoarts">Xenoarts &amp; Sensory Design</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=creative-interstellar-stories">Interstellar Stories &amp; Mythmaking</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=creative-crossworld-media">Crossworld Media &amp; Translation</a></li></ul></details></li><li><details><summary>Offworld Homes &amp; Daily Life</summary><ul><li><a href="/?forum=home-habitats-stations">Habitats, Stations &amp; Shipboard Homes</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=home-mixed-species-living">Mixed-Species Homes &amp; Accessibility</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=home-frontier-settlement">Frontier Settlements &amp; New Communities</a></li></ul></details></li><li><details><summary>Interstellar Food &amp; Hospitality</summary><ul><li><a href="/?forum=food-alien-ingredients">New Ingredients &amp; Alien Ecologies</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=food-multispecies-kitchens">Multispecies Kitchens &amp; Dietary Access</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=food-orbital-hospitality">Orbital Hospitality &amp; Destination Dining</a></li></ul></details></li><li><details><summary>Star Travel, Systems &amp; Destinations</summary><ul><li><a href="/?forum=travel-solar-system">Solar System Routes &amp; Habitats</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=travel-nearby-stars">Nearby Star Systems &amp; Colony Travel</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=travel-galaxy-destinations">Galactic Destinations &amp; Deep-Range Voyages</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=travel-spaceports-customs">Spaceports, Customs &amp; Passenger Care</a></li></ul></details></li><li><details><summary>Simulations, Star Games &amp; Shared Worlds</summary><ul><li><a href="/?forum=play-zero-g-sports">Zero-G Sports &amp; Interworld Competition</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=play-simulation-ethics">Simulations, Presence &amp; Play Ethics</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=play-alien-games">Games Across Cultures &amp; Species</a></li></ul></details></li><li><details><summary>Space, Cosmos &amp; Planetary Life</summary><ul><li><a href="/?forum=space-star-systems">Star Systems, Exoplanets &amp; Settlement Science</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=space-habitats-infrastructure">Habitats, Life Support &amp; Space Infrastructure</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=space-xenobiology-ecology">Xenobiology, Ecology &amp; Planetary Care</a></li></ul></details></li><li><details><summary>Multispecies Society &amp; Galactic Civics</summary><ul><li><a href="/?forum=civics-alien-neighbors">Alien Neighbors &amp; Everyday Belonging</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=civics-first-contact">First Contact, Diplomacy &amp; Cultural Consent</a></li><li><a href="/?forum=civics-interstellar-rights">Interstellar Rights, Mobil